OL,3,GNEWSAThousands of new species
OL,4,Adiscovered in island
OL,5,
OL,6,FResults from a survey of Guernsey's
OL,7,Ffreshwater habitats have been called
OL,8,F"nothing short of incredible" as they
OL,9,Freveal thousands of new species to the
OL,10,Fisland.
OL,12,FThe project from Guernsey Water and the
OL,13,FGuernsey Nature Commission used
OL,14,Fenvironmental DNA to look for genetic
OL,15,Ftraces left behind by organisms in the
OL,16,Fwater.
OL,18,FThe survey detected 2,630 organisms
OL,19,Facross 36 different groups, 2,249 of
OL,20,Fwhich had not been previously been
OL,21,Frecorded in the Guernsey Biological
OL,22,FRecords Database.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
